{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Against"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVが公開されましたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一期生で歌わせてもらいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして生駒ちゃんセンターの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんとみなみちゃんのフロント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生生星ですね(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの頃はそんなに意識して居なかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつの日からか、ファンの皆さんからこの三人の形を好きだと言って下さいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラストという事で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私なりに沢山考えて、スタッフさんと考えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Againstは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒のやりたい事をアイデアとして使って頂く事になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この一期生だから、この仲間だからやりたいし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挑戦したい事"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと頭の中でいつ形に出来るかとチャンスを伺っていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今だ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と今しか出来ないと行動に移しました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲は私にとっては挑戦で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はこの7年間でどれだけの事が身についたのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして自分の中にあるこれはなんだろう..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"形にしたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というワクワクキラキラを現実にする為に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂との出会いは失いたくないからで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水玉模様を撮って下さった丸山健志監督にお願い出来ますかと声をかけ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスは様々踊ってきて学んだ事をと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分もやった事のないジャンルを踊りたかったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台 こちら葛飾区亀有公園前派出所 で共演しました福澤侑さんにお願いしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が教えてくれた様々な表現を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここに一つにまとめたらどうなるだろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その一人の人間の為に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際に動いて下さった皆様に感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成したMVは私が観たかったものでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな意見があると思いますがそこは最後のご愛嬌という事で〜〜(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挑戦と一番安心する心強い一期生と作品を作る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも大変な撮影の中最高の物を出してくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ見たことない面があるのか。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄いよ〜(´；ω；｀)☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、生駒が全てアイデア出した訳ではございませぬのでね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにはどう映ったのだろうか、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観たかったものではない方も、逆にキタコレって思って下さった方も。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンクロニシティでも、私はとても自由に舞っていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振り付けはインフルエンサーでもお世話になったSeishiroさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかSeishiroさんの作品でもっともっと舞ってみたいのが私の目標(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"監督は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を作った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言ってもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキンの池田一真さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にまた撮って頂けて光栄です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと今後も私には制服のマネキンが生き続けると思うから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなに綺麗に写ってて少しびっくりしましたし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何よりも私は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンクロニシティを見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂だと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","